comments.body:
> It's working now. The problem was that my Dexcom was still paired to my old my phone.

@tobiasAPS - Did you remember how you unpaired your old phone from your Dexcom? I tried xDrip's System Status -> "Forget Device" button on my old phone, but my new Pixel 2 still hasn't collected any readings after 30 minutes.
![screenshot_20181022-124658](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9965388/47309661-9e596880-d5fa-11e8-9095-7f9296a67224.png)

Aha, the old phone managed to _not_ forget the device. Setting it to airplane mode, then hitting Forgot Device worked.

New phone is now collecting.

@jamorham - Bug ^^ ?
